# Intentionally empty. SiYuan's native auth (SIYUAN_ACCESS_AUTH_CODE) is bypassed by
# setting SIYUAN_ACCESS_AUTH_CODE_BYPASS=true in docker-compose.yaml — the kernel
# then grants every request admin access with no lock screen. The whole subdomain is
# protected by Traefik basic auth using the customer's server password, the same
# pattern as draw.io. The app's hostname is supplied automatically as AF_APP_DOMAIN.
